    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/f868f224705f58a0ea72e187f2dcd981.avif?t=1726146846\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>As the plot progresses, you'll learn that the lab was testing a novel kind of bioweapon when something terrible went wrong. You will experience the narrative from the monster's point of view and fight for your right to survive rather than playing the role of the traditional human hero saving humanity from a monster.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/231ed68f5e553fdbf635324c3d88f052.poster.avif?t=1726146846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/231ed68f5e553fdbf635324c3d88f052.webm?t=1726146846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/231ed68f5e553fdbf635324c3d88f052.mp4?t=1726146846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your character's capacity to mutate and change shape is among this game's most intriguing elements. As you advance through each level, you'll learn new skills, getting faster, stronger, and more dangerous. To further exert control over your surroundings, you will also be able to possess both people and animals.<br><br>The path to freedom will be complex, so heed this warning. You'll need to move past several barriers, such as traps, doors, elevators, and lasers, while figuring out tricky puzzles that will put your intelligence to the test. Get ready to flex your problem-solving skills and emerge victorious as the ultimate monster hero.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/f868f224705f58a0ea72e187f2dcd981.avif?t=1726146846\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>As the plot progresses, you'll learn that the lab was testing a novel kind of bioweapon when something terrible went wrong. You will experience the narrative from the monster's point of view and fight for your right to survive rather than playing the role of the traditional human hero saving humanity from a monster.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/231ed68f5e553fdbf635324c3d88f052.poster.avif?t=1726146846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/231ed68f5e553fdbf635324c3d88f052.webm?t=1726146846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553650/extras/231ed68f5e553fdbf635324c3d88f052.mp4?t=1726146846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your character's capacity to mutate and change shape is among this game's most intriguing elements. As you advance through each level, you'll learn new skills, getting faster, stronger, and more dangerous. To further exert control over your surroundings, you will also be able to possess both people and animals.<br><br>The path to freedom will be complex, so heed this warning. You'll need to move past several barriers, such as traps, doors, elevators, and lasers, while figuring out tricky puzzles that will put your intelligence to the test. Get ready to flex your problem-solving skills and emerge victorious as the ultimate monster hero.<br><br>",
    "short_description": "Do you have what it takes to make it out of a top-secret laboratory's depths? If so, are you up for the ultimate challenge? You play as a powerful monster in this action-packed platformer game, using your unique skills to solve puzzles and take down enemies in your quest for freedom.",
